  "goodToKnow": "Der Pakt is a pact: einen Pakt schließen. History: the Hitler-Stalin-Pakt of August 1939, with its secret protocol dividing Eastern Europe, and der Warschauer Pakt (Warsaw Pact, 1955–1991), which the GDR belonged to. Today: der Stabilitätspakt (EU fiscal rules), der Digitalpakt Schule (school digitalisation funding). Faust makes a famous Pakt mit dem Teufel. Paktieren means to collude. Plural: die Pakte."
